	(text "REF5025E 2.5 V for VREFHIA-D; OPA2388 buffers VMID 1.25 V (diff-amp offset)\nand VBIAS 2.5 V (ID/NTC bias); TMUX1208 for 4 NTC + 4 ID; 24 V monitor; AGND star"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
