	(text "MII to the CM EMAC (GPIO105-124, mux 14), own 25 MHz oscillator, 49.9 R MDI\nterminations to AVD; MDI pairs, LEDs and the centre-tap supply ETH_CT go to SYS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.5 186 0)
		(effects
			(font
