		(uuid "cc0388f0-e3c7-59c9-8758-2ba4f98d6215")
	)
	(text "TPS3703 windows on 3.3 V and 3.3 V analog, UV supervisor on 1.2 V -> XRSn;\n25 MHz CMOS clock into X1; boot straps GPIO72/GPIO84 (flash by default)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 118.5 54 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "df947832-175d-5442-8b60-e1ea13b9fd50")
	)
	(text "SYS side: inputs via 74LVC244A / 74LVC1G17 (Ioff); I2C pull-ups and EEPROM 0x57 here; ETH_CT = PHY AVD; PORT +24V via its own eFuse."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 256 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e242ab13-6676-563b-884c-af47e1a9844e")
	)
	(text "Protection without firmware: FLT_LATCH_N -> INPUTXBAR1 -> TZ1; each cell's FAULT (INPUTXBAR2-5) and AN1 CMPSS window -> TRIP4/5/7/8; port OV (ADC PPB on VA/VB, CMPSS backup), open inputs (CMPSS low), IA/IB SC (CMPSS) and OC (PPB), P_ID (PPB) -> TRIP9 for every cell; E-stop ->"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 232 0)
		(effects
